==Battleground==
*1 [[Dark Otter]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*2 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Le'noir]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
**4 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Since the Dark Otter and Lenoir/Gory Darks are split up from each other, you don't need as much anti-Dark as you might anticipate. Still, bringing a decent area attacker, perhaps an Uber, is the best way to guarantee a win here as well as a meatshield.

